  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transition to low carbon irrigation technologies for increased productivity, food security and enhanced livelihoods in Lori and Shirak regions of Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the implementation of Armenia&#x2019;s NDCs in reducing carbon emissions from energy use in irrigated agriculture in Lori and Shirak regions of Armenia, which will promote climate resilient agriculture and increase irrigated lands for human security, improved livelihoods and resilience in a sustainable way.</narrative>
  </description>
